@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Graderate)

[*] --> WaitingState : start date arrives

state WaitingState <<choice>>
WaitingState --> ActivateRate : current date equals or surpasses start date
WaitingState --> [*] : end of validity period not reached

state ActivateRate
ActivateRate : entry / activate the rate
ActivateRate : do / maintain active state until finish date
ActivateRate : exit / mark as expired

ActivateRate --> WaitingState : finish date is reached

state ExpiredState <<choice>>
ExpiredState --> RemoveRate : one year from expiration date
ExpiredState --> [*] : removal not initiated

state RemoveRate
RemoveRate : entry / remove or archive the rate
RemoveRate : do / complete removal process
RemoveRate : exit / completion of removal

RemoveRate --> [*]

@enduml
